# mf_{{id}}

Microfrontend {{Pascal}}. It exports `{{id}}Manifest`, and all its routes live under `/{{id}}` (`{{Pascal}}Paths`). Demo mode only: the data comes from `Fake{{Pascal}}Repository`.

## Routes

- `/{{id}}`: list of items. Each item opens its detail.
- `/{{id}}/:id`: detail of one item, a child of the list so it has a back button.

Each screen is a `StatelessWidget` that gets its controller with `ControllerBuilder`. The screens are gathered in `lib/src/screens/{{id}}_screens.dart` (`{{Pascal}}Screens.list` and `{{Pascal}}Screens.detail`), which the manifest calls from the deferred library. Each one takes its repository from the `MicrofrontendScope` of the current identity, through `{{Pascal}}Data`.

## To write

- The domain: the `{{Pascal}}Repository` port, its types and the demo data.
